OL,3,ABrazil's Lula bans online gambling
OL,4,Aahead of presidential election
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrazilian President Luiz Inacio Lula da
OL,7,FSilva has announced a ban on online
OL,8,Fgambling, just days before an election
OL,9,Fin which he is seeking a fourth term as
OL,10,Fthe country's leader.
OL,12,FLula, who is running against the son of
OL,13,Fthe incarcerated former Brazilian
OL,14,FPresident Jair Bolsonaro, signed a
OL,15,Fprovisional order on Friday that
OL,16,F"prohibits all sports betting and
OL,17,Fonline casinos".
OL,19,FThe online gambling industry in Brazil
OL,20,Fwas legalised in 2018 and has since
OL,21,Fbeen blamed for widespread household
OL,22,Fincome losses due to addiction.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
