OL,3,ABrazil's Lula bans online gambling
OL,4,Aahead of presidential election
OL,5,
OL,6,FLula described the industry as a
OL,7,F"cancer" in his announcement, adding
OL,8,F"either we remove the tumour, or it
OL,9,Fkills us".
